{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/224183-angel-s-cover-s-questions","id":224183,"title":"Angel's Cover's Questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-10T09:18:24-07:00","id":224183,"title":"Angel's Cover's Questions","content":"When the God-Machine creates a Cover for an angel, does he creates a whole new person or he &quot;overwrites&quot; someone on Earth?<br /> <br /> Also, if the angels can possess and/or materialize, why do they need a Cover?<br /> <br /> Thanks in advance guys","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3677-fpmonteiro","name":"fpmonteiro","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-10T10:16:42-07:00","id":224250,"title":"","content":"1) Either, depends on the Occult Matrix used to make them.<br /> <br /> 2) Different tools for different jobs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-10T10:23:59-07:00","id":224254,"title":"","content":"First of all, angels use Infrastructure to hide what they are. Cover is what Demons have left over after they're disconnected.<br /> <br /> Nitpicks aside, the answer is &quot;it depends.&quot; If the angel is needed briefly, or anonymously, then a new person among the teeming billions already on earth is usually the way to go. The G-M can indeed &quot;overwrite&quot; people it needs to, though they probably need to be taken to a Facility, or at least the process needs to be overseen by an angel, giving the victim a small possiblity of escape.(Adventure hook!)<br /> <br /> The G-M does has other options at its disposal if an angel needs to be place for an extended period. The short fiction &quot;Untimely&quot; (pg 73. DtD) is one example.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-10T14:03:18-07:00","id":224460,"title":"","content":"Generally speaking an angel is given a shape when it manifests that is very similar to a human and this allows it to retain it's &quot;cover&quot;. It does not have a literal Cover score like the Unchained. Alternatively, an angel can possess a human being and use that human to perform tasks. It rarely needs to &quot;overwrite&quot; the entire existence of a human being in order for it to achieve these things. Angels can have very inhuman shapes, however, so you might wonder how these angels are able to manifest without causing panic? This is where the &quot;Mortal Mask&quot; numen comes in. This numen can be used at the same time as Manifestation and allows the Angel to appear human as soon as they appear. These identities never have to be more than &quot;generic person&quot; as few people will notice. Occasionally however infrastructure will create the necessary paperwork and history an angel needs to appear more definably real.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-10T17:06:25-07:00","id":224649,"title":"","content":"Okay, so the doubts that remains for me is &quot;how the Demon creates his first Cover at the moment she Falls&quot;. The Infraestructure for the angel &quot;Cover&quot; is created piece by piece? I mean, do they buy the house, clothes, ID, car, alter memories of people to be their family etc.? Or is it like the Soul Pact, that overwrites someone for the angel to live within?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3677,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3677-fpmonteiro","user":"fpmonteiro","date":". 08-10-2014, 08:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3677-fpmonteiro","name":"fpmonteiro","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-10T17:23:04-07:00","id":224655,"title":"","content":"The latter. The process of Falling causes the wishy washy paperwork and flimsy backstory to be editted into reality as &quot;real human identity&quot;, providing not just a cover story, but often shifting reality to produce the house, family, job, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-10T17:24:08-07:00","id":224659,"title":"","content":"Actually, reading page 117, Angel-jacking, it seems like the God-Machine creates a Cover for his angels out of nothing by an output of an Occult Matrix.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3677-fpmonteiro","name":"fpmonteiro","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-10T17:33:28-07:00","id":224664,"title":"","content":"I understand now. Thank you very much guys!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3677-fpmonteiro","name":"fpmonteiro","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}